WEBVTT

00:12:00.257 --> 00:12:02.134
(Laughter)

00:12:02.176 --> 00:12:06.430
Be prepared for the losses in phase two.

00:12:07.181 --> 00:12:11.268
Experiment and try as many
different things as you can

00:12:11.310 --> 00:12:12.895
in phase three.

00:12:13.187 --> 00:12:16.982
And squeeze all the juice
out of retirement

00:12:16.982 --> 00:12:18.150
in phase four.

00:12:18.192 --> 00:12:20.194
(Applause)